# Pyrite Building elevator (native C5) for build/test_story_route: from the
# Colosseum checkpoint (private/pyrite/saves/pyrite-2-colosseum.gci, floor
# 0x78) through the bridge event into 1F, then 1F surface 4 (door row 138)
# up to 3F. The up-ramp to 4F is only reachable from 3F's elevator room
# (docs/pyrite-story.md): the arrival must put Wes there, not at entrance 0.
floor 0x78 0
expect 0x409 1
door 2
at 35 -339
expect 0x40a 1
expect 0x40b 1
expect_floor 0x19
touch 4
expect_floor 0x1b
expect_near -10 -150 12
walk -20 -140
# Back down: 3F surface 9 (row 140) lands beside 1F's elevator.
walk -10 -146
touch 9
expect_floor 0x19
expect_near 3 -51 12
touch 4
expect_floor 0x1b
walk -20 -140
walk -20 -118
door 7
expect_floor 0x1c
